              "frontTextStyle": "type1",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "title",
              "value": "📣 BIGO ICON Upcoming Event Preview"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "fill",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🎯 1. Beagle Icon Elimination Match\n"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Main Event Dates: August 5 – August 13\nPreliminary Round: August 5 – 8\nSemifinals: August 9 – 11\nFinals: August 12 – 13\n(Exact cut-off times for each round will be announced later.)\n\n📌 Division Assignment Rules:\nBased on host level in June or July:\nHosts who reached S level or above in either month will be placed in Division A (Advanced Group)\nAll others will join Division B (General Group)"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🏆 Both divisions will feature leaderboard rewards and tiered bonus unlocks.\n⏳ A revival mechanism will be introduced during the semifinals—details coming soon.\n🎁 Additionally, any host who accumulates 2.5 million Beans from August 1–13 will be awarded an exclusive offline ticket to Colombia, including flight and hotel accommodation!"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "fill",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "🎡 2. Beagle Icon Lucky Draw"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "During the event, hosts can earn lottery tickets by collecting Beans daily. Spin to win prizes such as:\n🏅 BIGO ICON limited avatar frames, pendants, and decorations\n✈️ Offline event ticket + flight + hotel to Colombia\n💰 Tons of Beans\n🦕 Exclusive physical Dino reward\n\nThe more tickets you earn, the greater your chances to win!"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "fill",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "📺 3. Beagle Icon Exclusive Channel Activity"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "Event Dates: August 5 – 13\nCollect designated gifts during live streams to earn points and unlock extra Bean rewards — a perfect opportunity to boost your performance outside the elimination rounds!"
            },
            {
              "frontTextStyle": "underline",
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "⚠️ Please note that some rules may be slightly adjusted before the event officially launches. Kindly refer to the final live version for the most accurate details."
            }
          ]
